{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st03","storyGroup":"act39side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act39side_level_act39side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EP-ST-3","storyName":"别了，大地","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"跟随哈维尔的船员们回到镇子，跟随胡安娜的船员们准备与棘刺一同出海，帕斯卡拉去寻找她的好生活，每个人都选择了各自想要的未来。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act39side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["哈维尔","兴奋的商人","鲁斯","商人","帕斯卡拉","车队的商贩","车队成员A","车队成员B","车队成员A&B","蒂奇","胡安娜","伊西多","激动的船员","兴奋的船员","害羞的孩子","惊喜的路人","冷漠的路人","小伊西多","好奇的船员","着急的船员","疑惑的船员","船员们","亢奋的船员","犹豫的船员","？？？","宝宝"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_bg_57_g13_ibtown_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"subtitle","text":"半个月后","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"只剩下这一艘完好的盐船，其他的多多少少都有受损，但大部分构件和材料都能拆下来用。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"这本是盐船的设计图纸，上面边边角角地附带点开船技巧。这张是盐漠地图。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"哈哈哈，好，我都要！要是真的能从盐漠里走，商队能省不少时间！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"你出个价吧，我们爽快点！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"这个数，要全用多布隆金币结。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"哈哈，没问题！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"给，你看看，钱是不是对的？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"嗯......没错。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"好！那我先走了，你们继续忙！","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":32},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"这人怎么这么爽快......哈维尔，我是不是要少了？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"嘿，等等！","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"呃......怎么了？","id":43},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔追上去两步，顺着绳子爬上了甲板。","id":45},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_57_g3_newdeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"这个舵轮我留下了！多少钱？我退给你！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"商人","text":"哦，哦，舵轮啊！这可是一艘船上最重要的东西呢。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"商人","text":"你想要拿回去？那我要——","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"商人","text":"这个数。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"商人","text":"哎，表情别这么难看啊，老兄！刚刚交易已经达成了，它们现在是我的船了，对吧？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"商人","text":"公平交易嘛，看它在你心里值不值得这个价了！","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......算了......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1256_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的商人","text":"可惜啊，那下次有机会再交易咯。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_1256_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_bg_57_g13_ibtown_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"——船员们！都过来吧！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"这些就是刚刚卖盐船得来的钱，我们平分，一人一份。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"拿了这笔钱，就去干你们自己想干的事情吧。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"给，鲁斯，你的份。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"......","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"怎么了？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"说实在的，我还没有想好我接下来要去做什么。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"做个决定，很简单的事情。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"......之前，我想的是离开胡安娜，安稳点。后来我觉得你也是个疯子，跟着你也不会安稳。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"现在我站在这个镇子里，看着镇上这些人，又瘦又干，眼睛里一点光都没有......这里过的真是安稳日子吗？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"如果我不在这里，去别的地方，以我那些海盗本事，能过得上安稳的日子吗？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"说出来不怕你笑话，我其实挺佩服蒂奇的。她比我大几岁，一直都很有主见。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"那天，我看到她伤成那样，还是打定主意要跟着胡安娜出海......真犟啊......也真够厉害，我可能就没这个胆子。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"哈哈......不说我了。你呢，哈维尔？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我应该会换个地方开个餐馆吧。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1590_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"唔......就这样吧，抽完这支烟，我也就上路了。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁斯","text":"人嘛......谁又能知道呢？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1590_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":112},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"盐船逐渐远去，哈维尔望着那白色的风帆和鲁斯的背影一并消失在视线里。","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":121},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":123},{"type":"text","text":"他把自己的那份钱收进口袋，向着下一个路口，走远了。","id":124},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_bg_bg_desert_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"喂，这个多少钱？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队的商贩","text":"一个银币。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"这个呢？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队的商贩","text":"也是一个银币。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"唔，不贵嘛！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"那这个、这个和这个，都给我包起来，放到我后面这辆车上。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队的商贩","text":"好嘞！哎呦，您买这么多东西，这是要去哪啊？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"我想要就买了，怎么了？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_006","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队的商贩","text":"没怎么，您看到什么想要的直接和我说就好！我都包好了送您车上！","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_006.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"哼哼，这还差不多。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"嗯......买了衣服买了首饰还买了各种小玩意......怎么还是感觉少点什么......","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"唔......少点什么呢......","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#6$1","focus":"none","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A","text":"（小声）......对啊，你也很震惊吧！","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员B","text":"（小声）但我怎么知道会这样啊？天啊......","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（......嗯？他腰带上的那个卡扣真好看啊......亮闪闪的......）","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（是什么做的，金属？宝石？......好想要......）","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,-20","duration":"2.5","isblock":"false","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（好想要啊......）","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A","text":"（小声）......那只不过是他们在路上偶然发现的东西，就挖出来带着了，想着随便卖点钱......","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员B","text":"（小声）有人收吗？真没想到......","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（没注意到我，马上就能拿到了......）","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A","text":"（小声）......谁能想到他们居然开了这个价钱......这个数！你下半辈子都不用愁了！","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员B","text":"（小声）所以咱们这次去也是干这个的？","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（嘿......到手！）","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A","text":"（小声）对......去哥伦比亚，我们挣笔大的......","id":174},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"（挣笔大的？）","id":179},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"帕斯卡拉把手一松，卡扣稳稳地落回了那人的腰带上。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"什么挣笔大的？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#15$1","focus":"none","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A&B","text":"啊！","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车队成员A","text":"你怎么偷听别人说话！","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"嘿嘿。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"如果是别人，我可不会这样搭话的，但两位老兄，看起来极为出众，很不一般呢。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"所以我才敢这样冒昧上前......","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"这是我的路费，去哥伦比亚这么远，路上无聊，两位老兄给我也讲讲呗？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_bg_57_g6_olddeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":201},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_pirate_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":202,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"夫人，我们真的要出海了吗？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"呼......居然真的会有这样的一天......","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"哦，是的，小珍珠，我们是要出海了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"......真不敢相信......","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜拢了拢被风吹乱的头发，望向身后。","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多，这下我们真的一无所有了，但我打定心思想要出海。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你还愿意和我们一起走吗？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"胡安娜女士......","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你可以当我的大副吗？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"那么，我的船长，准备好了......嗯？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipcannon","volume":"0.5","id":232},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"看来我的老朋友在闹脾气了......让我看看有什么办法能让她消消气。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_bg_57_g6_olddeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"唔......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"嗯......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你这几十年的老传动核心，果然还是受不住新装的动力系统吗......","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"嘶......温蒂已经乘着她改造的小艇回去了，我们只好自己修修看了。船上还剩什么材料？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多，你的那个包里有什么东西，怎么这么鼓？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"都是极境之前塞给我的东西，但都没什么用，我都不知道到底是......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"先拿出来看看，说不定有用呢。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$aluminum","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多打开自己的背包，里面塞满的东西一下子全掉了出来。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜和蒂奇凑上前，翻看起来。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"嗯？维生素片？这个是出海需要的东西啊！","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"通讯设备和防水靴也是......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"这些工具......好像可以拿来修船。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"哦，极境真是个好小伙子，这些东西现在可不好找呢。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"这两样我先拿走了，估摸着能解决一下刚才的问题。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":280},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"看你的表情，你不知道这些事？这么多东西，难道是我们分开的那天他给你的？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不......那天我们没有道别。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"前段时间，他隔一阵子就塞给我一个，我都放到包里了。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"原来，他早就看出来了。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"甚至，比我自己还要早。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你的好兄弟还能看不出你的心思吗？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"好了，问题解决了！","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的船员","text":"解决了？那我们可以出发了吗？","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的船员","text":"呦呼——","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的船员","text":"出海——出海——出海——！","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"去吧，船长，该决定我们航行的方向了。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多从胡安娜的手中接过望远镜。","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"无垠的盐漠上盐粒随风翻涌，像雪白的浪花，但他的视线飞快地掠过了这片虚假的海，投向极远处的天边，投向那一抹亮蓝的栖所。","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"他独自一人站在了船头，伸出自己的手臂，看着上面的光芒流转，等待着它给出一个方向。","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"1","id":321},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":322},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_bg_57_g14_ibtown_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0.3","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"他站在街上，刚刚合起了手掌，夜空中最后一粒星光的碎屑也消散殆尽，黑暗再次笼罩下来。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害羞的孩子","text":"烟花结束了，我们走吧？","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的路人","text":"走吧走吧，该回家了。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷漠的路人","text":"哼......","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"路人们纷纷散去，曾因他而聚集起来的人们，又离开了他。","id":332},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1.5","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小伊西多","text":"......","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1","id":341},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":342},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_bg_57_g6_olddeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜见他迟迟没有反应，便大步上前，蒂奇也跟着踏上了舰艏的甲板。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"船员们一个接一个地凑上前，想看看他们的新船长究竟看到了什么。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"于是，伊西多的身边围满了人，直到落在后面的船员不得不伸着脖子挤进人堆。","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的船员","text":"什么，什么？船长你到底在看什么？","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"着急的船员","text":"是还没有找到方向吗？","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的船员","text":"往哪里开才是海？我们现在开的方向对吗？","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多没有回答他们的问题，他只是专注地看着自己的手臂。","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的船员","text":"它怎么一直在转来转去的？","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"着急的船员","text":"它什么时候才会指方向啊？哪里才是我们要去的地方呢？","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好奇的船员","text":"啊......我们会去向哪里呢？","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"别急，别急，我们的船长会告诉我们答案的。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"那么现在......","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"该去往的方向是哪里呢？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"仿佛是在回答他的提问一般，他手臂上的流光不再毫无规律地游走，而是笔直且坚定地向天边漾起涟漪。","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"他向往着和身边这群伙伴一起开向那传说中广袤无垠的海洋，于是心相原质为他指出了大海的方向。","id":372},{"type":"text","text":"船员们欢腾起来，朗姆酒泼洒出来——","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的船员","text":"那里！是那边！","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的船员","text":"是大海！","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"所有人的目光都聚集在伊西多的身上。","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"下令吧，船长！","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"船员们的手中已经拿上了帆绳，胡安娜的手也放在了舵轮上，只等他下一句命令。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多深吸一口气，回望向那些期盼他开口的赤诚目光，他发自内心地感到，自己此刻不再惧怕承担起这份期盼。","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"盐漠上的风吹向他，他觉得如释重负。","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"船员们！","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"拔起船锚，升起船帆——","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"——我们出海！","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oicrwd","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"船员们","text":"出海——","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"船员们","text":"嘿——呦——！♪","id":394},{"type":"dialog","id":395},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_turnrudder_2","channel":"4","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_57_i13.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":401},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-50","duration":"60","block":"false","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":403},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_chasing_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":404,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_largesail_wind","channel":"3","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":407},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandship_fast","channel":"5","volume":"1","loop":"true","id":408},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ship_sand","channel":"1","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"subtitle","text":"升起船帆嘿，收起船锚嘿♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":411},{"type":"subtitle","text":"让狂风撕扯我们的衣衫♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":412},{"type":"subtitle","text":"让暴雨浇醒我们的酒意♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":413},{"type":"subtitle","text":"准备！出发！港口的船有千千万万只！♪","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":414},{"type":"subtitle","id":415},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"亢奋的船员","text":"我要和海浪搏斗！我要在风浪上航行！我要与雷电击剑——","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的船员","text":"我要找到埋藏在深海的宝藏！闪闪发光的金币！","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的船员","text":"但是......但是......我刚刚在想，我们现在因为想要一起出海才聚在了一起......","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"犹豫的船员","text":"会不会未来有一天，我们有了不同的想法，就不会再在一起了？","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"......哈，未来？那也离现在太远了，小子！","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"不论未来会怎么样，现在我们是在一起的，我们会一同出海！","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"别想那么多，拉紧你手里的帆索！","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多船长，酒已经在手中，来说一句吧！","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多站上船头，空气中的水汽逐渐丰盈起来，他感受到了这种令人兴奋的潮湿。","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"敬远方。","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":429},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"1.5","id":430},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":432},{"type":"dialog","id":433},{"type":"charslot","id":434},{"type":"image","id":435},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_bg_57_g6_olddeck_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piratepet_vo01","id":440},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......哼哧......","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......哼哧......哼哧......","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"嗯？什么声音？怎么这么熟悉......？","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"charslot","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piratepet_vo01","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......哼哧......","id":450},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1586_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝宝","text":"啾叽！","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1586_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"宝宝？！","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"宝宝！你还活着！","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1586_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝宝","text":"（狂舔胡安娜的脸颊）","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1586_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"唔唔......","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你是来和我们一起出海的吗？","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1586_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝宝","text":"（兴奋地弹来弹去）","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1586_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"哦，你真是我的好宝宝！","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":469},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":470},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":471},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":472},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"charslot","id":474},{"type":"image","id":475},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_57_g1_saltdesert_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":477},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sand02","layer":"1","flip":"1","id":478},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sand_lp","channel":"2","loop":"true","id":479},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":480},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":481},{"type":"text","text":"一道血痕从氤氲的蒸汽中延伸开去，蔓延向无边无际的盐漠深处。","id":482},{"type":"text","text":"冰冷的舌头品尝着口腔中的血腥，残缺的四肢由一股无主的强烈欲望驱使着向前挪动。","id":483},{"type":"text","text":"不远处，一条触肢挣扎着破开盐层，向着它久违的日光蠕行。而后是第二条、第三条......","id":484},{"type":"text","text":"另一股无主的强烈欲望驱使着暗淡的发光器官向太阳高高扬起，仿佛要从中借得光芒。","id":485},{"type":"dialog","id":486},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bonrcver","id":487},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":488},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bonbrke","id":489},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":490},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":491},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bonbrke","id":492},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":493},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"他只是想活下去，它也只是想活下去。","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"不择手段，不择形态。","id":496},{"type":"text","text":"人的残躯与海嗣的残骸挣扎着，蠕动着，饥渴地互相吞噬。","id":497},{"type":"text","text":"它们将永生地行走大地。","id":498},{"type":"dialog","id":499},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":500},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"bgeffect","id":503},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":504},{"type":"charslot","id":505},{"type":"background","id":506},{"type":"image","id":507}],"characters":["哈维尔","兴奋的商人","鲁斯","商人","帕斯卡拉","车队的商贩","车队成员A","车队成员B","车队成员A&B","蒂奇","胡安娜","伊西多","激动的船员","兴奋的船员","害羞的孩子","惊喜的路人","冷漠的路人","小伊西多","好奇的船员","着急的船员","疑惑的船员","船员们","亢奋的船员","犹豫的船员","？？？","宝宝"]}